# Macro editing (nxt)

## Before broad search

1. Root `GCODE.md` — find M/G code → macro file
2. `rg` under `macros/` for the code or symbol name

## Line length

See [gcode-line-length.mdc](gcode-line-length.mdc). Run both checkers before done.

## Global OM size

See [om-global-size.mdc](om-global-size.mdc). New globals: [nxt-global-lifecycle.mdc](nxt-global-lifecycle.mdc) (declare-or-set → user-vars overlay). When editing `nxt-vars.g`, `nxt-boot.g`, tool table, or Custom persistence, run `node dist/check-om-global-budget.mjs`.

## Probe tool helpers

| Macro | Role |
|-------|------|
| `system/nxt-probe-tool-sync.g` | M4000 probe row |
| `system/nxt-probe-tool-ready.g` | Select T + sensor active |
| `system/nxt-probe-sensor-wait.g` | Sensor wait only |

## Do not read

- Full `docs/DETAILS.md` (legacy MOS)
- Entire `G6512.g` unless editing probe core — use targeted `rg`
